From: PS5_Proton <local@invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] dnsapi: report unavailable Unix backend without dispatching through null

DllMain logs an unavailable resolver backend but still permits PE imports.
DnsQueryConfig must report that unavailable capability, rather than dispatch
through a null Unix function table. A console GetAdaptersAddresses trace
reproduces STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION at table index 1 with handle zero.
Keep the ordinary error visible; this does not provide DNS configuration.

--- a/dlls/dnsapi/dnsapi.h
+++ b/dlls/dnsapi/dnsapi.h
@@ -130,4 +130,5 @@
     unix_funcs_count
 };
 
-#define RESOLV_CALL( func, params ) WINE_UNIX_CALL( unix_ ## func, params )
+#define RESOLV_CALL( func, params ) \
+    (__wine_unixlib_handle ? WINE_UNIX_CALL( unix_ ## func, params ) : ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED)
